### 1. Missing fields → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email" }

### 2. Wrong password → 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff1@example.com", "password": "wrong" }

### 3. Me without login → 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me

### 4. Correct login → 200 + user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff1@example.com", "password": "Staff@123" }

### 5. Me after login → 200 + user (cookie sent automatically)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me

### 6. Logout → 204
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/logout